  "subject": "the one thing that keeps opening doors for you",
  "text": "I've been reading the market for you every day, and I've found the one thing that would open the most doors.

The roles you'd want most are built around product analytics. That makes it the single most valuable thing you could put in front of me.

product analytics shows up in 3 of the 5 roles closest to you, that's where the doors are.

- senior PM postings increasingly require product analytics (source: https://example.com/report)
- Market pay for Product managers (US): about $145,000 median (BLS: https://www.bls.gov/oes/x.htm)

If product analytics is already part of your story, even a little, showing me opens this whole set of roles. And if it's something you're growing into, now you know exactly where to aim, and I'll be watching for it, with you.

Send me anything that shows it, a project, a story, a couple of lines, and I'll weave it into everything I look for from here.

Charlie",
}
